 installation steps.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                =
                &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                   =
             &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                       =
             &lt;p&gt;In the next step, tap the Window key + R.&lt;/p&gt;=0A           =
