                                                  &lt;p&gt;Next, the Run dialogue=
 box will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                     =
           &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                        =
        &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                            =
        &lt;p&gt;Now, enter =E2=80=9Ccontrol/name Microsoft.DevicesAndPrinters.=
=E2=80=9D=0A                                                               =
