                                 &lt;li&gt;=0A                                   =
                                 &lt;p&gt;Now, enter =E2=80=9Ccontrol/name Micros=
oft.DevicesAndPrinters.=E2=80=9D=0A                                        =
                            &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                        =
                        &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                           =
                     &lt;li&gt;=0A                                               =
